  "explanation": "The central register (D-GQXM8) is the sole Tier‑1 source available, and no Tier‑1 or Tier‑2 evidence independent of the register exists to confirm or contradict its listed beneficial owners. The self‑declaration (D-9ASZQ) is Tier‑3 and thus not sufficient for verification. Per R2, when reliable independent evidence is missing, the correct action is to request the missing document (e.g., a business‑register shareholder excerpt) before any discrepancy determination can be made."
}

