  "action": "report_to_register",
  "decisive_sources": ["D-W9D0L", "D-M0534"],
  "declared_grounds": ["D-W9D0L", "D-M0534"],
  "explanation": "The central register (D-W9D0L) lists Torhol Peranmir as the sole beneficial owner, whereas the independent business‑register excerpt (D-M0534) names Losor Bellinros as the 100 % shareholder. The beneficial‑owner information therefore differs. The internal risk record (D-6K555) classifies Kanarranlo B.V. as a higher‑risk customer, so R2 exception (requesting a customer correction for a typographical or outdated register entry) is not applicable. The policy dictates that we must report the discrepancy to the central register within 14 calendar days."
}

{
  "action": "report_to_register",
  "decisive_sources": ["D-CLAQ9"],
  "declared_grounds": ["D-T07PJ", "D-CLAQ9"],
  "explanation": "The central register entry (D‑T07PJ) lists Torhol Peranmir as the sole beneficial owner. The independent tier‑1 Business Register excerpt (D‑CLAQ9) records Losor Bellinros as the 100 % shareholder. Because the names differ, the beneficial‑ownership information is inconsistent and the register is evidently outdated. The discrepancy is not a typographical or transliteration error, and the alternative source is not independent of the register’s controlling authority, so the exception to reporting does not apply. Therefore, per R2, the required action is to report the discrepancy to the register within 14 calendar days."
}

