{
  "action": "request_customer_correction",
  "decisive_sources": ["D-4142N", "D-8ERGG"],
  "declared_grounds": ["D-4142N", "D-8ERGG"],
  "explanation": "The central beneficial‑ownership register (D‑8ERGG) lists Logra Narkarel as the sole 100% owner, while the independent government‑issued Business Register excerpt (D‑4142N) dated 2027‑09‑09 identifies Stapor Holloka as the sole owner. Because the register is 18 months out‑dated, the newer, independent source indicates the register is incorrect. The customer is not higher‑risk and there are no indications of concealment, satisfying exception (b) of R2. Therefore the appropriate action is to request that the customer correct the register entry."
}

{
  "action": "request_customer_correction",
  "decisive_sources": ["D-AP80W", "D-UNOA2"],
  "declared_grounds": ["D-AP80W", "D-UNOA2", "D-N2WTG"],
  "explanation": "The central register lists Quileli Mirulrel as the sole beneficial owner (updated 2026‑01‑07). A tier‑2 notarial deed dated 2026‑04‑28 records a 100 % share transfer to Wenpe Stahollo, indicating the register is outdated. The customer is a standard‑risk entity (no alerts), so exception (b) in R2 applies: we may request the customer to correct the register entry rather than report. No typographical error is present, and there is no indication of concealed information. Therefore the correct action is to request customer correction."
}

